 "5386": {
  "inputs": {
   "value": "16:9 horizontal, cinematic wide shot, bright daylight.\n\n<Picture 1> is Lin Ye. <Picture 2> defines the blocky grassland: grass blocks, blocky oak trees, square clouds, distant blocky mountains.\n\nShot 1 (0-4s), medium shot. Lin Ye stands up and looks around — the grassland is completely empty. No other people, no silhouettes, no figures anywhere, only grass, trees and distant mountains. He freezes, confused.\nShot 2 (4-7s), wide shot, camera slowly rises. Kilometres of open grass roll to the horizon; not a single person in sight — except, far away on the horizon, a single faint point of light glimmers. This is the \"Era Glimmer\": every player sees it at the moment of entry.\nShot 3 (7-10s), close-up. He cups his hands around his mouth and shouts into the emptiness. No answer — only wind and a faint echo.\n\nSound: wind over open ground, a faint far bird call, his own voice echoing once into nothing.\nVoiceover (Lin Ye, in Mandarin Chinese): \"不只是我——天边，有一点光。\"\nDialogue (Lin Ye, in Mandarin Chinese): \"喂——！有人吗——！\"\nRule: absolutely no other person in this segment — he is the only living thing in the world. No crowd, no distant figures, nobody at all.\nNo text, no letters, no subtitles, no logos, no watermarks, no brand marks and no UI overlays anywhere in the frame — the only exception is the system panel lines specified above."
  },
  "class_type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
  "_meta": {
   "title": "提示词",
   "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
   "ver": "0.33.0"
  }
